    "add_a_country": "Add one block: name_key, status, gs1, codes, ignored, ocr (only if the number is PRINTED), fmd + fmd_national_ai, and a dataset block when a free/open catalogue exists. Run the guard test; the app picks it up with no code change.",
    "occlusion_warning": "Do not copy the Italian rule to another country: only Italy prints the AIC while forbidding the barcode. Germany prints the PZN as text AND as Code 39; France puts the CIP-13 in the EAN-13 itself; the US prints the NDC as text and uses UPC/EAN."
